        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "上六的爻辞是：王公发箭射击盘踞在高城之上的恶隼，一举将其射获，没有什么不利的。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
